# Claude Code per-user state. Two deliberate exceptions:
#   .claude/settings.json  — pins AWS_PROFILE=guestnote. The `default` profile on
#     this machine is the employer's shared production account, so this file is a
#     guardrail, not a preference. It belongs in the repo.
#   .claude/skills/        — project-level skills, shared.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills
!.claude/skills/**

# Generated share image for the holding page; deploy.sh re-renders it from og.html.
coming-soon/og.png

# Impeccable (design skill) runtime state. `.impeccable/surfaces/` holds the surface
# briefs and IS documentation — it stays. Everything else here is per-machine or
# per-session: the question server's transcripts, and live-mode's injection targets.
.impeccable/questions/
.impeccable/live/
